#: kstart.cpp:267
#, fuzzy
msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Comando para executar."

#: kstart.cpp:269
msgid "A regular expression matching the window title"
msgstr ""

#: kstart.cpp:270
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A string matching the window class (WM_CLASS property)\n"
"The window class can be found out by running\n"
"'xprop | grep WM_CLASS' and clicking on a window.\n"
"NOTE: If you specify neither window title nor window class,\n"
"then the very first window to appear will be taken;\n"
"omitting both options is NOT recommended."
msgstr ""
"Unha expresión regular que encaixe co título da fiestra.\n"
"Se non se indica ningunha, tomarase a primeira fiestra que\n"
"apareza. ¡Non recomendado!"

#: kstart.cpp:276
#, fuzzy
msgid "Desktop on which to make the window appear"
msgstr "Escritorio onde debe aparece-la fiestra. "

#: kstart.cpp:277
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application"
msgstr ""
"Facer que a fiestra apareza no escritorio que estaba activo\n"
"cando se executou a aplicación."

#: kstart.cpp:278
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "Facer que a fiestra apareza en tódolos escritorios"

#: kstart.cpp:279
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "Iconifica-la fiestra"

#: kstart.cpp:280
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "Maximiza-la fiestra"

#: kstart.cpp:281
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maximize the window vertically"
msgstr "Maximiza-la fiestra"

#: kstart.cpp:282
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maximize the window horizontally"
msgstr "Maximiza-la fiestra"

#: kstart.cpp:283
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show window fullscreen. Implies type Override"
msgstr "Amosar fiestra en pantalla completa. Implica tipo Con Preferencia"

#: kstart.cpp:284
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog, TopMenu or Override"
msgstr ""
"O tipo de fiestra: Normal, Escritorio, Acoplada, Ferramenta, \n"
"Menú, Diálogo ou Con Preferencia"

#: kstart.cpp:285
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"Ir para a fiestra mesmo se é iniciada nun\n"
"escritorio virtual diferente"

#: kstart.cpp:288
msgid "Try to keep the window above other windows"
msgstr "Tentar manter a fiestra por riba doutras fiestras"

#: kstart.cpp:290
msgid "Try to keep the window below other windows"
msgstr "Tentar manter a fiestra embaixo doutras fiestras"

#: kstart.cpp:291
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "A fiestra non aparece na barra de tarefas"

#: kstart.cpp:292
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "A fiestra non ten unha entrada no paxinador"

#: kstart.cpp:293
#, fuzzy
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker"
msgstr "A fiestra envíase á bandexa do sistema en Kicker."

#: kstart.cpp:300
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "KStart"

#: kstart.cpp:301
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special "
"decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"Utilidade para lanzar aplicacións con propiedades especiais para\n"
"a fiestra, como iconificada, maximazada, nun determinado escritorio\n"
"virtual, cunha decoración especial, e outras."

#: kstart.cpp:321
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "Non se indicou un comando"

